  <item>
    <title>On Owning Your Words</title>
    <link>https://example-writer.wordpress.test/2024/03/10/on-owning-your-words/</link>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Mar 2024 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <dc:creator><![CDATA[janewriter]]></dc:creator>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">https://example-writer.wordpress.test/?p=101</guid>
    <description></description>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Every piece you publish on a platform is a small negotiation you didn't get to read the terms of.</p>
<script>trackVisit('on-owning-your-words');</script>
<p>Here is a photo from the archive.</p>
<img src="https://tracker.example-writer.wordpress.test/pixel.gif" width="1" height="1" alt="" />
<p>And a video that explains it better than I can:</p>
[embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fake123example[/embed]
<p>That's the whole argument, really.</p>]]></content:encoded>
    <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[A platform can change its terms, its algorithm, or its existence.]]></excerpt:encoded>
